                                                "sense_id": "dbf303ff-fe92-387c-b174-6cefcbf3cbd2",
                                                "text": "A lasagne that feels like lasagne except made from mung and urad beans; the whole thing is then served – as if to remind you, again, of what it is not – with a thumb of cucumber."
                                            }
